# Ignore file of UI/apps/svt-db-agent-next/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# The build context is the repository root: send UI/ and Shared/ only.
*
!UI
!Shared

# The former UI/.dockerignore, with the UI/ prefix of the root context.
**/node_modules
UI/dist
UI/.nx
UI/.angular
UI/*.md
UI/**/*.spec.ts
UI/**/*.test.ts
UI/.env*
UI/pm2
UI/postgresql
UI/scripts
UI/Deployment
